OL,3,AAnthropic shares close up 17% after
OL,4,Arecord-breaking stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FShares in AI firm Anthropic have closed
OL,7,F17% higher on their first day of
OL,8,Ftrading after the company was listed
OL,9,Fpublicly for the first time on the
OL,10,FNasdaq stock market in New York
OL,12,FThe company's share price started at
OL,13,F$111.50, which at that stage gave it a
OL,14,Fmarket value close to $2tn - prices
OL,15,Fthen dropped slightly to close at
OL,16,Faround $97
OL,18,FThat's still a steep jump from the $83
OL,19,Fset last night - take a closer look at
OL,20,Fsome of the numbers here
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
