OL,3,AAnthropic shares close up 17% after
OL,4,Arecord-breaking stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic, the company behind AI
OL,7,Fchatbot Claude, had raised a record
OL,8,F$81bn ahead of its stock market debut
OL,10,FThe seven founders who set up Anthropic
OL,11,Fin 2021 have now become
OL,12,Fmulti-billionaires - this is who made
OL,13,Fthe most money today
